ter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/04/sitime-corporation-sitm-q4-2020-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"SITM 2021 Q1","e":"sitm","d":"2021-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Chris Caso","x":"Is this a function of new design wins perhaps raising prices?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/sitime-corporation-sitm-q1-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"SITM 2021 Q1","e":"sitm","d":"2021-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Chris Caso","x":"Are you able to raise prices on existing customers given the environment?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/sitime-corporation-sitm-q1-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"SITM 2021 Q2","e":"sitm","d":"2021-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Rajesh Vashist","x":"And we want to respect that with our customers, and therefore, we are very, very judicious with our price increases, both in the amplitude of the price increase and the frequency of it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/05/sitime-corporation-sitm-q2-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"SITM 2021 Q2","e":"sitm","d":"2021-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Rajesh Vashist","x":"So we, for example, have many customers who may not have seen any price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/05/sitime-corporation-sitm-q2-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"SITM 2021 Q3","e":"sitm","d":"2021-11-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Art Chadwick","x":"For example, TSMC has publicly stated they are raising prices by 20% or more.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/sitime-corporation-sitm-q3-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"SITM 2021 Q3","e":"sitm","d":"2021-11-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Rajesh Vashist","x":"We all know semiconductor companies that have taken somewhat, shall we say, undue advantage of their pricing power in the past.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/sitime-corporation-sitm-q3-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"SITM 2021 Q4","e":"sitm","d":"2022-02-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Art Chadwick","x":"For example, TSMC is raising prices by 20% or more across the board on the nodes we use.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/02/sitime-corporation-sitm-q4-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"SITM 2021 Q4","e":"sitm","d":"2022-02-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tom O'Malley","x":"You talked about TSMC raising prices with the 200- to 300-bp impact.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/02/sitime-corporation-sitm-q4-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"SITM 2022 Q2","e":"sitm","d":"2022-08-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Rajesh Vashist","x":"In May, when we increased our guidance from 35% to 50% annual growth, we did not anticipate the subsequent conditions financial downturn, supply chain disruptions and political turmoil, all of which made it difficult for our customers to see the magnitude and the speed of decline in their own…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/04/sitime-corporation-sitm-q2-2022-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"SITM 2023 Q2","e":"sitm","d":"2023-08-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rajesh Vashist","x":"SiTime created the category of precision timing to serve the needs of applications like automated driving, data center, 5G and AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/02/sitime-sitm-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SITM 2023 Q3","e":"sitm","d":"2023-11-01","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rajesh Vashist","x":"SiTime created precision timing, to serve the needs of applications like automated driving, data center, 5G, and AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/02/sitime-sitm-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SITM 2023 Q3","e":"sitm","d":"2023-11-01","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rajesh Vashist","x":"Additionally, by combining our men's and oscillators with these clocks, we believe that a whole new category, of precision timing products will be created for our core markets of comms, data center, and AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/02/sitime-sitm-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SITM 2023 Q4","e":"sitm","d":"2024-02-13","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rajesh Vashist","x":"SiTime created precision timing to serve the needs of applications like automated driving, data center, 5G, and AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/13/sitime-sitm-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SITM 2023 Q4","e":"sitm","d":"2024-02-13","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rajesh Vashist","x":"The massive amount of data processing required for AI requires network infrastructure upgrades, which depend upon precision timing to deliver and process data at high speeds while maintaining uptime.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/13/sitime-sitm-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SITM 2024 Q1","e":"sitm","d":"2024-05-08","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rajesh Vashist","x":"SiTime's precision timing solutions serve the needs of AI, data center, automated driving, IoT and 5G.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/08/sitime-sitm-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SITM 2024 Q1","e":"sitm","d":"2024-05-08","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rajesh Vashist","x":"In North America, customers are developing enterprise AI systems and all aspects of data center network infrastructure such as switches, smartNICs, optical modules and active electrical and optical cables.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/08/sitime-sitm-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SITM 2024 Q2","e":"sitm","d":"2024-08-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rajesh Vashist","x":"SiTime's precision timing solutions serve the needs of AI, data center, automated driving, IoT, and 5G.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/08/sitime-sitm-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SITM 2024 Q2","e":"sitm","d":"2024-08-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rajesh Vashist","x":"Within CED, we have made progress in our AI business over several quarters and I will spend time today to provide greater color on this.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/08/sitime-sitm-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SITM 2024 Q3","e":"sitm","d":"2024-11-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rajesh Vashist","x":"Whether it is in AI data centers, networking infrastructure, automated vehicles, personal mobility or IoT, SiTime's precision timing delivers better performance and reliability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/07/sitime-sitm-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SITM 2024 Q3","e":"sitm","d":"2024-11-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rajesh Vashist","x":"In both Q2 and Q3 2024, CED has been a major driver of our growth, driven by cloud service provider investments in AI infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/07/sitime-sitm-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SITM 2024 Q4","e":"sitm","d":"2025-02-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rajesh Vashist","x":"…in a dynamic new semiconductor category that we call precision timing, which is the heartbeat of modern electronics, whether it's in AI, data centers, networking infrastructure, automated vehicles, personal mobility, or IoT, SiTime's precision timing delivers better performance and reliability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/06/sitime-sitm-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SITM 2025 Q4","e":"sitm","d":"2026-02-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rajesh Vashist","x":"Additionally, our 2026 CED forecast has grown since our last earnings call driven by increases in AI CapEx spending.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/sitime-sitm-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SITM 2025 Q4","e":"sitm","d":"2026-02-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Beth Howe","x":"The combination of deep engagement in AI infrastructure, and broad participation across diverse segments positions us exceptionally well for continued growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/sitime-sitm-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SITM 2026 Q1","e":"sitm","d":"2026-05-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Beth Howe","x":"Sequentially, revenue was essentially flat with Q4, significantly better than anticipated at the beginning of the quarter, primarily driven by stronger-than-expected demand in AI data center applications.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/sitime-sitm-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SITM 2026 Q1","e":"sitm","d":"2026-05-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Beth Howe","x":"This growth reflects the breadth of demand across AI infrastructure, including optical modules, switches, SmartNICs and accelerator platforms.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/sitime-sitm-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SITM 2026 Q2","e":"sitm","d":"2026-08-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rajesh Vashist","x":"The 3rd driver is the expansion of AI data centers spending beyond traditional hyperscalers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/sitime-sitm-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SITM 2026 Q2","e":"sitm","d":"2026-08-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rajesh Vashist","x":"We have talked several times about the diverse nature of SiTime's business, and a strong example is AI beyond data center and into cars, humanoid robots, drones, and personal AI devices each of which opens a new opportunity for our precision timing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/c